Acknowledgments and third-party provenance

This firmware is a fork of, and substantial rewrite from, the original
BEKANT firmware projects. The author gratefully acknowledges:

  - https://github.com/ivanwick/bekantfirmware
    (the original "Programmable position memory for IKEA BEKANT
    adjustable sit/stand desk" project; released without an explicit
    license; many of its design ideas live on in src/, especially
    the LIN driver and the memory-position encoding layout)

  - https://github.com/DieSteinhose/bekantfirmware
    (the "double-tap" gesture fork; merged into the unified state
    machine in src/btn/btn.c)

  - The IKEA BEKANT reverse-engineering community, the
    Microchip PIC16LF1938 datasheet authors, and the broader open-
    source firmware community.

The OEM firmware disassembly reference in oem_reconstruction/ is a
best-effort C reconstruction by the author; the original OEM binary
(orginafirm.hex) was contributed by community members and is shipped
in oem_reconstruction/disassembly/ for reference only.

The file src/README-ORIGINAL.md is a verbatim historical copy of
ivanwick's README retained for provenance.

The Microchip PIC12-16F1xxx DFP (dfp/pic12-16f1xxx/) and XC8 compiler
are Microchip products; see the upstream Microchip licenses at
https://www.microchip.com/ for terms.
